[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-012-event-sourcing-pattern.md#5-event-versioning-and-schema-evolution]

#### 5. Event Versioning and Schema Evolution

As business requirements evolve, event schemas must change while maintaining backward compatibility with historical events.

**Event Versioning Strategy:**

```csharp
// Version 1 - Original event
public class ClaimAdjudicatedEventV1
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; set; }
    public string AdjudicationResult { get; set; }  // "Approved" or "Denied"
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; set; }
    public DateTime AdjudicatedAt { get; set; }
}

// Version 2 - Added denial reason and rules evaluated
public class ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; set; }
    public string AdjudicationResult { get; set; }
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; set; }
    public DateTime AdjudicatedAt { get; set; }

    // New fields (optional for backward compatibility)
    public string? DenialReason { get; set; }
    public List<string>? RulesEvaluated { get; set; }
}

// Upcasting - convert old events to new format when loading
public class EventUpcaster
{
    public IDomainEvent Upcast(StoredEvent storedEvent)
    {
        return storedEvent.EventType switch
        {
            "ClaimAdjudicatedEvent" when storedEvent.EventVersion == 1
                => UpcastClaimAdjudicatedV1ToV2(storedEvent),

            "ClaimAdjudicatedEvent" when storedEvent.EventVersion == 2
                => JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2>(
                    storedEvent.EventData),

            _ => throw new NotSupportedException(
                $"Unknown event type/version: {storedEvent.EventType} v{storedEvent.EventVersion}")
        };
    }

    private ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2 UpcastClaimAdjudicatedV1ToV2(
        StoredEvent storedEvent)
    {
        var v1 = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ClaimAdjudicatedEventV1>(
            storedEvent.EventData);

        // Convert V1 to V2, providing defaults for new fields
        return new ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2
        {
            ClaimId = v1.ClaimId,
            AdjudicationResult = v1.AdjudicationResult,
            ApprovedAmount = v1.ApprovedAmount,
            AdjudicatedAt = v1.AdjudicatedAt,
            DenialReason = null,  // Not available in V1
            RulesEvaluated = null  // Not available in V1
        };
    }
}
```

**Schema Evolution Best Practices:**

1. **Additive Changes Only**: Add new fields with optional/nullable types; never remove or rename fields
2. **Event Version Number**: Include `event_version` in every event for upcasting logic
3. **Upcasting on Read**: Convert old events to new format when loading from event store
4. **Multiple Event Handlers**: Support multiple event versions in handlers during transition periods
5. **Deprecation Strategy**: Mark old event versions as deprecated but continue supporting indefinitely

