[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-012-event-sourcing-pattern.md#1-event-granularity]

#### 1. Event Granularity

**Too Coarse** (Avoid):
```csharp
// One event for entire claim lifecycle
public record ClaimProcessedEvent
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; init; }
    public string FinalStatus { get; init; }
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; init; }
    // Problem: Loses intermediate states, cannot replay individual steps
}
```

**Too Fine** (Avoid):
```csharp
// One event per field change
public record ClaimStatusChangedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimAmountChangedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimProviderChangedEvent { /* ... */ }
// Problem: Too many events, aggregate reconstruction slow
```

**Just Right** (Recommended):
```csharp
// One event per meaningful business state transition
public record ClaimSubmittedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimValidatedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimAdjudicatedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimApprovedEvent { /* ... */ }
public record ClaimDeniedEvent { /* ... */ }
```

