#### 3. Optimistic Concurrency

Always use version checking to prevent concurrent modification conflicts:

```csharp
public async Task AppendEventsAsync(
    Guid aggregateId,
    IEnumerable<IDomainEvent> events,
    long expectedVersion)
{
    var currentVersion = await GetAggregateVersionAsync(aggregateId);

    if (currentVersion != expectedVersion)
    {
        throw new ConcurrencyException(
            $"Aggregate {aggregateId} version mismatch. " +
            $"Expected {expectedVersion}, found {currentVersion}");
    }

    // Append events...
}
```

