[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-012-event-sourcing-pattern.md#semantic-versioning-for-events]

#### Semantic Versioning for Events

**Version Number Format**: `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`

- **MAJOR**: Breaking changes (rename/remove field, change type)
- **MINOR**: Non-breaking additions (new optional field)
- **PATCH**: Documentation/example updates only

**Examples:**

```csharp
// Version 1.0.0 - Initial release
public record ClaimAdjudicatedEventV1
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; init; }
    public string AdjudicationResult { get; init; }
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; init; }
}

// Version 1.1.0 - Added optional denial_reason (minor version bump)
public record ClaimAdjudicatedEventV1_1
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; init; }
    public string AdjudicationResult { get; init; }
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; init; }
    public string? DenialReason { get; init; }  // Optional, backward compatible
}

// Version 2.0.0 - Changed adjudication_result to enum (major version bump)
public record ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2
{
    public Guid ClaimId { get; init; }
    public AdjudicationResult AdjudicationResult { get; init; }  // Breaking change
    public decimal ApprovedAmount { get; init; }
    public string? DenialReason { get; init; }
}
```

page_texts.57:
[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-012-event-sourcing-pattern.md#upcasting-strategy]

#### Upcasting Strategy

Convert old event versions to new versions when loading from event store:

```csharp
public class EventUpcaster
{
    public IDomainEvent Upcast(StoredEvent storedEvent)
    {
        var eventType = storedEvent.EventType;
        var version = storedEvent.EventVersion;

        // Always upcast to latest version
        return (eventType, version) switch
        {
            ("ClaimAdjudicatedEvent", 1) => UpcastV1ToV2(storedEvent),
            ("ClaimAdjudicatedEvent", 2) => DeserializeV2(storedEvent),
            _ => throw new NotSupportedException(
                $"Unknown event {eventType} version {version}")
        };
    }

    private ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2 UpcastV1ToV2(StoredEvent storedEvent)
    {
        var v1 = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ClaimAdjudicatedEventV1>(
            storedEvent.EventData);

        // Convert V1 to V2 format
        return new ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2
        {
            ClaimId = v1.ClaimId,
            AdjudicationResult = v1.AdjudicationResult == "Approved"
                ? AdjudicationResult.Approved
                : AdjudicationResult.Denied,
            ApprovedAmount = v1.ApprovedAmount,
            DenialReason = null  // Not available in V1
        };
    }

    private ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2 DeserializeV2(StoredEvent storedEvent)
    {
        return JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ClaimAdjudicatedEventV2>(
            storedEvent.EventData);
    }
}
```

