[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-012-event-sourcing-pattern.md#tiered-storage-strategy]

#### Tiered Storage Strategy

Optimize storage costs by moving old events to cheaper storage tiers:

```plaintext
Hot Tier (0-90 days):

  - PostgreSQL primary database
  - Fast random access for aggregate loading
  - High IOPS, low latency
  - Cost: $$$

Warm Tier (90 days - 2 years):

  - PostgreSQL archive database or AWS S3
  - Occasional access for temporal queries
  - Medium latency acceptable
  - Cost: $$

Cold Tier (2-7 years):

  - AWS S3 Glacier / Azure Cool Blob Storage
  - Rare access, retrieval time hours
  - Compliance/legal discovery only
  - Cost: $
```

**Archival Implementation:**

```csharp
public class EventArchivalService
{
    private readonly IEventStore _eventStore;
    private readonly IS3Client _s3Client;

    public async Task ArchiveOldEventsAsync()
    {
        // Archive events older than 90 days to S3
        var cutoffDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-90);

        await foreach (var @event in _eventStore.StreamEventsOlderThanAsync(cutoffDate))
        {
            // 1. Upload to S3
            var s3Key = $"events/{event.CreatedAt:yyyy/MM/dd}/{event.EventId}.json";
            await _s3Client.PutObjectAsync(new PutObjectRequest
            {
                BucketName = "gainwell-event-archive",
                Key = s3Key,
                ContentBody = JsonSerializer.Serialize(@event),
                StorageClass = S3StorageClass.StandardInfrequentAccess
            });

            // 2. Delete from hot tier (retain in S3)
            await _eventStore.DeleteFromHotTierAsync(@event.EventId);

            // 3. Record archival metadata for retrieval
            await RecordArchivalLocationAsync(@event.EventId, s3Key);
        }
    }

    public async Task MoveToGlacierAsync(DateTime olderThan)
    {
        // Move events older than 2 years to Glacier
        var cutoffDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddYears(-2);

        // Use S3 lifecycle policy to automatically transition to Glacier
        await _s3Client.PutLifecycleConfigurationAsync(new PutLifecycleConfigurationRequest
        {
            BucketName = "gainwell-event-archive",
            Configuration = new LifecycleConfiguration
            {
                Rules = new List<LifecycleRule>
                {
                    new LifecycleRule
                    {
                        Id = "archive-old-events",
                        Status = LifecycleRuleStatus.Enabled,
                        Transitions = new List<LifecycleTransition>
                        {
                            new LifecycleTransition
                            {
                                Days = 730,  // 2 years
                                StorageClass = S3StorageClass.Glacier
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        });
    }
}
```

